            "reviewBody": "Ive made this recipe multiple times over the past few years. Everyone who has tried the sweet pickles ive made loves them. Only thing is i make them with lemon cucumbers. And 1 batch = 1 quart jar completed.",
            "datePublished": "2023-08-29T18:36:31.547Z"
