              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Hapygrl"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is such an easy recipe, and it makes 1 qt of pickles. I used 4 smaller cucumbers. No need to boil for 5 minutes, just until the sugar is dissolved. Allow to cool before pouring over the cucumbers for a crisper pickle. The amount oof brine is correct as the cucumbers release liquid as they sit in the brine.",
